  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4302.07 Electronic record",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4302.07 “Electronic record” means “electronic record” as defined in RSA 294-E:2, VII namely, “a record created, generated, sent, communicated, received, or stored by electronic means”.\n\nSource. #9376, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10026, eff 11-16-11; ss by #13037, eff 4-20-20",
